      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w21.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "避難所の朝は、毛布と、味噌汁の匂いがする。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "半壊した闘技場は、立ち入り禁止。私の受付台は、瓦礫の下だ。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "チームは、遠くの収容施設にいる。面会の申請は、「検討中」の判を押されて返ってきた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "検討中。この会社の言葉は、待たせるときだけ豊かになる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "世界は、救われた。街の人は、毛布の列で笑い合っている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "救った本人たちだけが、ここにいない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰も悪気なく「よかったねえ」と言う。そのたび、うまく笑えなかった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "手帳を開いても、書くことがない。予定の欄が、白い。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "白い予定表が、こんなに重いとは知らなかった。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "マダムが、見舞いに来た。「宝くじ、また買ってきたわ。次は当てないでね」的外れで、優しい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "菓子折りは、今回も八つ裂き大福だった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "避難所のどこかで悲鳴が上がって、少しだけ場が明るくなった。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.direction.mimi.shift.006",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s1.w21.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "午後、ノノさんを見つけた。拾った板で、小さな受付台を作っていた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「受付が無いと、困る人が出ますから」この人は、世界が半分壊れても、正式なままだ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "炊き出しの列で、剣士さんの隣になった。椀を受け取りながら、世間話の声で言った。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「滅亡はの、毎回、誰かが立て直すんじゃよ」",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「一度目は勇者が。二度目は王様が。三度目は——忘れた」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「とにかく、誰かがやる」椀をすすり、横目で私を見た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「……今回は、誰かのう」耳が、ぴくりと動いた。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰か。味噌汁を、ゆっくり飲み干した。白い予定表と、瓦礫の受付台と、収容施設の三人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s1.w21.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "やることの無い一週間の底で、やることの形が、ぼんやり見え始めていた。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s1.w21.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
    "status": "review",
    "sourceDocument": "docs/MAIN_STORY_SCRIPT.md",
    "authorNote": "語り口V2・二行枠で改稿。週21嘆き週(9行+選択)。笑いは大福悲鳴とマダムの的外れの優しさだけに絞る。剣士さんの「今回は、誰かのう」が反転の引き金。進捗の道標を置かなくてよい週(構成設計どおり)。選択肢は撤去(判断週ではないため)。",
    "legacyGeneratedIds": false
